	<Trans i18nKey="mythos.intro">
		<p>
			The Monument Mythos is a tale developed by MISTER MANTICORE (Alex
			Casanas) via YouTube. The series have 3 seasons and a Spin-Off known
			as <a href={localizePath("data/nixonverse")}>THE NIXONVERSE</a>.
		</p>
	</Trans>
	<h1>{t("data.syn")}</h1>
	<Trans i18nKey="mythos.synop">
		<p>
			The series chronicles the strange happenings that America doesn't
			usually talk about, or do you think an entire government would
			chatter about a monster inside the Statue of Liberty like it's
			nothing?
			<br>
			Some similar things happen all over the country (and somewhere
			in Egypt), like an entire island that actively sprawls, a parallel dimension,
			an “angel” inside the Air-Force One and a crystal as sharp as it is mysterious.
		</p>
	</Trans>
